step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Brundt</col> in the longhall to start the quest. (Fairy ring DKS and run south-west to Rellekka) , or if started or finished <col=800000>Mountain Daughter</col></col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Brundt in the longhall to start the quest. (Fairy ring DKS and run south-west to Rellekka) , or if started or finished Mountain Daughter</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>The trials may be done in any order, however this quick guide will show you the fastest order.</col>
